id: E096
title: CMake cmake_minimum_required VERSION < 3.5 不兼容 CMake 4.x
category: build_system
severity: critical
trigger:
  - cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.4)
  - CMake Error: Compatibility with CMake < 3.5 has been removed
context: olm 3.2.16 编译
platform: ohos-aarch64
solution:
  - 修改 CMakeLists.txt 中的 cmake_minimum_required VERSION 为 3.5 或更高
  - 例如: cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.5)
example: |
  # 修改前
  cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.4)
  # 修改后
  cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.5)
reference: https://cmake.org/cmake/help/latest/manual/cmake-policies.7.html
